      "writtenOn": "2026-10-05T11:19:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for your suggestion. I moved the lookup earlier so that tracked endpoints have their availability updated immediately, and the D-Bus reads are now only performed for endpoints that are not tracked yet.\n\nThis also fixes a small issue along the way: a failed property read used to cause the availability update to be dropped.\n\nOne side effect is that tracked endpoints no longer run `searchConfigurationFor` on a Connectivity change. Only fw-update uses configurations, and only during endpoint discovery. Newly discovered endpoints still run `searchConfigurationFor`.",
